OL,5,G2032 Discovery
OL,6,     FAeons before antibiotics stocked
OL,7,     Fpharmacy shelves, bacteria were
OL,8,     Fkilled by viruses called
OL,9,     Fbacteriophages. Could these
OL,10,     Fnew/old weapons take up the global
OL,11,     Fbattle with superbugs?
