OL,5,G0232 Assignment
OL,6,     FIn Germany the system makes it
OL,7,     Fhard for disabled people to find
OL,8,     Fwork. Often they find jobs in
OL,9,     Finstitutions that pay less than
OL,10,     Fminimum wage. So how could Germany
OL,11,     Fbe more inclusive?
OL,12,G0300 BBC News
OL,13,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,14,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FSamina Ali survives a near-fatal
OL,17,     Flabour but wakes from a coma
OL,18,     Funable to recognise her newborn
OL,19,     Fson. With only fragments of her
OL,20,     Fpast intact, she must rebuild her
OL,21,     Fmind and her life.
